    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6802" root="جيب" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَاقُوتٌ مُجَيَّبٌ</span></b>  <i>Hollowed</i> [<i>sapphires</i>]: occurring
in a trad. describing the banks of the river of
Paradise: but accord. to one reading, it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُؤْلُؤٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَوَّبٌ</span>; accord. to another, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَيَّبٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجَوَّفٌ</span>;
and accord. to another, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَيَّبٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَوَّبٌ</span>. (TA.)

